  "body": "### What is the issue with the Compatibility Standard?\n\n```\r\nLINK ERROR: Multiple possible 'border-bottom-left-radius' property refs.\r\nArbitrarily chose https://drafts.csswg.org/css-backgrounds-3/#propdef-border-bottom-left-radius\r\nTo auto-select one of the following refs, insert one of these lines into a &lt;pre class=link-defaults> block:\r\nspec:css-backgrounds-3; type:property; text:border-bottom-left-radius\r\nspec:css-borders-4; type:property; text:border-bottom-left-radius\r\n'border-bottom-left-radius'\r\n```",
